#, no-wrap
msgid "a. $|0\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "a. $|0\\rangle$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "b. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle\\right)$\n"
msgstr "b. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "c. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle\\right)$\n"
msgstr "c. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "d. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "d. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "e. $\\frac{3}{5}|0\\rangle+\\frac{4}{5}|1\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "e. $\\frac{3}{5}|0\\rangle+\\frac{4}{5}|1\\rangle$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Which of the following states show(s) qubits A and B entangled? Select all that apply.\n"
msgstr "State mana di bawah ini yang menunjukkan qubit A dan B terjerat? Pilih semua yang berlaku.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "a. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"
msgstr "a. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "b. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A$\n"
msgstr "b. $\\frac{4}{5}|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+\\frac{3}{5}|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "c. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A-|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"
msgstr "c. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A-|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "d. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"
msgstr "d. $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A\\right)$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "e. $|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A$\n"
msgstr "e. $|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this module, we prepared an entangled state: $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A\\right)$. But there are many other entangled states one could use for a similar protocol. Which of the states below could yield a 2-qubit measurement histogram like the following? Select the best response.\n"
msgstr "Dalam modul ini, kita menyiapkan state terjerat: $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_B|0\\rangle_A+|1\\rangle_B|1\\rangle_A\\right).$ Namun ada banyak state terjerat lain yang bisa digunakan untuk protokol serupa. State mana di bawah ini yang bisa menghasilkan histogram pengukuran 2-Qubit seperti berikut? Pilih respons terbaik.\n"

